# Google OAuth client ID — a "Web application" credential from Google Cloud
# Console, with these Authorized JavaScript origins:
#
#   https://alexbabcock212-ui.github.io
#   http://localhost:5173
#
# This value is public by design: Google's browser-only token flow has no
# client secret, and anything VITE_-prefixed is embedded in the shipped bundle.
# Never put an actual secret in a VITE_ variable.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
